{"title":"1976 AHSME Problems/Problem 24","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1976_AHSME_Problems/Problem_24&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>In the adjoining figure, circle <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/f/b/dfb064112b6c94470339f6571f69d07afc1c024c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$K$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"19\" height=\"14\" /> has diameter <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/7/e/57ee5125358c0606c9b588580ddfa66f83e607b7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AB$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"30\" height=\"14\" />; circle <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/5/9/859ccf4cd60c7bc6b8fa1afc9a42dc811a826d6f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$L$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" /> is tangent to circle <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/f/b/dfb064112b6c94470339f6571f69d07afc1c024c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$K$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"19\" height=\"14\" /> and to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/7/e/57ee5125358c0606c9b588580ddfa66f83e607b7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AB$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"30\" height=\"14\" /> at the center of circle <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/f/b/dfb064112b6c94470339f6571f69d07afc1c024c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$K$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"19\" height=\"14\" />; and circle <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/d/1/5d1e4485dc90c450e8c76826516c1b2ccb8fce16.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$M$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"21\" height=\"14\" /> tangent to circle <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/f/b/dfb064112b6c94470339f6571f69d07afc1c024c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$K$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"19\" height=\"14\" />, to circle <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/5/9/859ccf4cd60c7bc6b8fa1afc9a42dc811a826d6f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$L$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/7/e/57ee5125358c0606c9b588580ddfa66f83e607b7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AB$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"30\" height=\"14\" />. The ratio of the area of circle <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/f/b/dfb064112b6c94470339f6571f69d07afc1c024c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$K$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"19\" height=\"14\" /> to the area of circle <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/d/1/5d1e4485dc90c450e8c76826516c1b2ccb8fce16.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$M$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"21\" height=\"14\" /> is\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/b/0/7b0c55f990d80458f68a73509b9da6016ca29e1b.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"[asy] /* Made by Klaus-Anton, Edited by MRENTHUSIASM */ size(150); pair K=(0,0),B=(1,0),A=(-1,0),L=(0,0.5),M=(sqrt(2)/2,.25); draw(circle(K,1)^^A--B); draw(circle(L,0.5)^^circle(M,.25)); label(&quot;$A$&quot;, A, W); label(&quot;$K$&quot;, K, S); label(&quot;$B$&quot;, B, E); label(&quot;$L$&quot;, L); label(&quot;$M$&quot;, M); [/asy]\" width=\"252\" height=\"205\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/7/2/372ba07d0027e448e4a19e84d32753f1ad6f7d8f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A) }12\\qquad \\textbf{(B) }14\\qquad \\textbf{(C) }16\\qquad \\textbf{(D) }18\\qquad  \\textbf{(E) }\\text{not an integer}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"483\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1976_AHSME_Problems/Problem_24&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/f/f/eff43e84f8a3bcf7b6965f0a3248bc4d3a9d0cd4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$R$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/5/5/b55ca7a0aa88ab7d58f4fc035317fdac39b17861.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> be the radius of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/c/3/cc3b37c8a5c0fc921295be325324ca0d19ef574e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\odot K$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"33\" height=\"16\" /> and the radius of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/2/a/e2a24235b9de51a73c7f53b7e8a265fc8087ed87.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\odot M,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"37\" height=\"16\" /> respectively. It follows that the radius of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/6/7966bee98dfba0342400c629e0bc2d5e60a6ad50.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\odot L$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"28\" height=\"16\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/3/c/e3cd376d0864a90af8d94d07720d421f619fb44b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{R}{2}.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"21\" height=\"37\" />\n</p><p>Suppose <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/b/4/4b4cade9ca8a2c8311fafcf040bc5b15ca507f52.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> is the foot of the perpendicular from <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/d/1/5d1e4485dc90c450e8c76826516c1b2ccb8fce16.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$M$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"21\" height=\"14\" /> to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/c/fcc7b3f8959dacf83fc38e182a60cea59b94cd5b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\overline{KL}.$\" width=\"32\" height=\"15\" /> We construct the auxiliary lines, as shown below:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/f/7/6f7737b24def11fe290b8c86de915476c2e1efa9.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"[asy] /* Made by Klaus-Anton, Edited by MRENTHUSIASM */ size(200); pair K=(0,0),B=(1,0),A=(-1,0),L=(0,0.5),M=(sqrt(2)/2,.25),I=(2*sqrt(2)/3,1/3),E=(sqrt(2)/3,1/3),P=(0,0.25); draw(circle(K,1)^^A--B); draw(circle(L,0.5)^^circle(M,.25)); draw(L--K,red); draw(L--M,red); draw(K--I,red); draw(P--M,red); label(&quot;$A$&quot;, A, (-5/4,0)); label(&quot;$K$&quot;, K, (0,-5/4)); label(&quot;$B$&quot;, B, (5/4,0)); label(&quot;$L$&quot;, L, (0,5/4)); label(&quot;$M$&quot;, M, (0,5/4)); label(&quot;$P$&quot;, P, (-5/4,0)); dot(K,linewidth(4)); dot(L,linewidth(4)); dot(M,linewidth(4)); dot(I,linewidth(4)); dot(E,linewidth(4)); dot(P,linewidth(4)); [/asy]\" width=\"335\" height=\"285\" />\nIn right <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/6/dc6ef9ab4a748517d94cbb6d93e5850fe2e39567.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\triangle KPM,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"73\" height=\"18\" /> we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/f/0/af09944404f38d169171cddcd8abbfd2908b1511.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$KP=r$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"66\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/2/b/62ba7abb7d5581baedc8a5e69ce2bfe9bd9da4f3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$KM=R-r.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"111\" height=\"16\" /> By the Pythagorean Theorem, we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/7/a/e7a109efaad7435d947de56d62c3840cdc9c33d4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$PM^2=(R-r)^2-r^2.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"177\" height=\"21\" />\n</p><p>In right <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/6/f/a6fe1ab5b11ac4f122112ff30314e8c60a349ff7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\triangle LPM,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"68\" height=\"18\" /> we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/3/f/83fed00f3a7e9ca5f5b242a5541f221dc9890f0e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$LP=\\frac{R}{2}-r$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"102\" height=\"39\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/9/f/d9f6fee223df864889513ea7583442fcf6f7038b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$LM=\\frac{R}{2}+r.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"111\" height=\"39\" /> By the Pythagorean Theorem, we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/8/d/98d07a81690049c44e753e0b78af78101a4c710a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$PM^2=\\left(\\frac{R}{2}+r\\right)^2-\\left(\\frac{R}{2}-r\\right)^2.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"263\" height=\"48\" />\n</p><p>We equate the expressions for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/5/0/3501627c3cb3fdf5c9633e032ef647db082b91e9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$PM^2,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"48\" height=\"20\" /> then simplify:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/5/5/c55b90bed0ae7b2bc2141e12ea9d95bf1fa6737f.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\begin{align*} (R-r)^2-r^2&amp;=\\left(\\frac{R}{2}+r\\right)^2-\\left(\\frac{R}{2}-r\\right)^2 \\\\ \\left(R^2-2Rr+r^2\\right)-r^2&amp;=\\left(\\frac{R^2}{4}+Rr+r^2\\right)-\\left(\\frac{R^2}{4}-Rr+r^2\\right) \\\\ R^2-2Rr&amp;=2Rr \\\\ R^2&amp;=4Rr \\\\ R&amp;=4r. \\end{align*}\" width=\"478\" height=\"170\" />\nTherefore, the ratio of the area of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/c/3/cc3b37c8a5c0fc921295be325324ca0d19ef574e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\odot K$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"33\" height=\"16\" /> to the area of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/2/a/82a4cb4eb4e4bcb249953ed1575bd5a0fab9ff96.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\odot M$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"33\" height=\"14\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/4/5/44506309bb0732b56c7f96b82a71541aa541018b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{\\pi R^2}{\\pi r^2}=\\left(\\frac{R}{r}\\right)^2=\\boxed{\\textbf{(C) }16}.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"208\" height=\"48\" />\n</p><p>~MRENTHUSIASM\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1976_AHSME_Problems/Problem_24&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1976_AHSME\" title=\"1976 AHSME\">1976 AHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1976_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1976 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1976_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1976 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1976\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1976_AHSME_Problems/Problem_23\" title=\"1976 AHSME Problems/Problem 23\">Problem 23</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1976_AHSME_Problems/Problem_25\" title=\"1976 AHSME Problems/Problem 25\">Problem 25</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1976_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1976 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1976_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1976 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1976_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1976 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1976_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1976 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1976_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1976 AHSME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1976_AHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1976 AHSME Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1976_AHSME_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1976 AHSME Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1976_AHSME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1976 AHSME Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1976_AHSME_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"1976 AHSME Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1976_AHSME_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"1976 AHSME Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1976_AHSME_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"1976 AHSME Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1976_AHSME_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"1976 AHSME Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1976_AHSME_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"1976 AHSME Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1976_AHSME_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"1976 AHSME Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1976_AHSME_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"1976 AHSME Problems/Problem 15\">15</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1976_AHSME_Problems/Problem_16\" title=\"1976 AHSME Problems/Problem 16\">16</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1976_AHSME_Problems/Problem_17\" title=\"1976 AHSME Problems/Problem 17\">17</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1976_AHSME_Problems/Problem_18\" title=\"1976 AHSME Problems/Problem 18\">18</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1976_AHSME_Problems/Problem_19\" title=\"1976 AHSME Problems/Problem 19\">19</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1976_AHSME_Problems/Problem_20\" title=\"1976 AHSME Problems/Problem 20\">20</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1976_AHSME_Problems/Problem_21\" title=\"1976 AHSME Problems/Problem 21\">21</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1976_AHSME_Problems/Problem_22\" title=\"1976 AHSME Problems/Problem 22\">22</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1976_AHSME_Problems/Problem_23\" title=\"1976 AHSME Problems/Problem 23\">23</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">24</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1976_AHSME_Problems/Problem_25\" title=\"1976 AHSME Problems/Problem 25\">25</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1976_AHSME_Problems/Problem_26\" title=\"1976 AHSME Problems/Problem 26\">26</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1976_AHSME_Problems/Problem_27\" title=\"1976 AHSME Problems/Problem 27\">27</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1976_AHSME_Problems/Problem_28\" title=\"1976 AHSME Problems/Problem 28\">28</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1976_AHSME_Problems/Problem_29\" title=\"1976 AHSME Problems/Problem 29\">29</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1976_AHSME_Problems/Problem_30\" title=\"1976 AHSME Problems/Problem 30\">30</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AHSME_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"AHSME Problems and Solutions\"> All AHSME Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div class=\"print\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;width:100%;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\">\n<div>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=File:AMC_Logo.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/d/d1/AMC_Logo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"97\" height=\"84\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a></span>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex-grow:1;text-align:right\">\n<p>These problems are copyrighted &#169; by the <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.maa.org\">Mathematical Association of America</a>. \n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017095128\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplicatio